# A machine never starts again a journal whose booking it released once,
# also when the coordinator books it there again. Convergence does not
# wait for a machine that stopped the journal, but the registry books it:
# the journal runs a member short while the cell believes it serves. The
# leads and controls oracles must catch it.
expect: caught
cause: controls: every control journal runs on its booked machines after chaos
file: crates/lib/paros-roles/src/node/control.rs
--- find
        for journal in booked {
--- replace
        for journal in booked {
            if self.journals.released(journal) {
                continue;
            }
--- end
